WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:08.987
There once lived an old man who had a cyst on his cheek.

2
00:00:09.908 --> 00:00:14.591
It was a rather big, ugly cyst and very hard to hide.

3
00:00:14.611 --> 00:00:17.474
"Ooh! I wish you were gone!"

4
00:00:17.974 --> 00:00:19.775
the man shouted at his cyst.

5
00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:26.100
The old man took medicines and applied creams.

6
00:00:27.622 --> 00:00:30.144
He even tried removing it by force.

7
00:00:31.144 --> 00:00:36.889
Whatever he did was useless because the cyst continued to grow bigger each day.

8
00:00:40.892 --> 00:00:44.715
Despite the ugly cyst, the old man had a good heart.

9
00:00:45.836 --> 00:00:47.858
He shared what he had with others.

10
00:00:47.878 --> 00:00:50.840
"I have more than enough!"

11
00:00:51.361 --> 00:00:52.521
he often said.

12
00:00:56.104 --> 00:01:00.168
While walking home one day, the sky suddenly turned dark.

13
00:01:00.944 --> 00:01:05.346
A terrible thunderstorm began, so the man ran for shelter.

14
00:01:06.286 --> 00:01:10.788
He found a hollow tree and hid inside it until the storm passed.

15
00:01:12.889 --> 00:01:17.071
When the rain finally stopped, the man stepped out of the tree.

16
00:01:18.131 --> 00:01:22.013
Suddenly he heard strange sounds of laughter and singing.

17
00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:24.854
"What in the world?"

18
00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:26.095
he wondered.

19
00:01:26.815 --> 00:01:29.256
The old man gasped at the sight.

20
00:01:32.528 --> 00:01:36.370
Just behind the tree, a group of goblins had gathered.

21
00:01:37.271 --> 00:01:41.833
They appeared to be having a party—dancing, singing, and drinking.

22
00:01:43.014 --> 00:01:47.436
As the old man watched, he soon began to enjoy himself too.

23
00:01:51.598 --> 00:01:54.340
One of the goblins was a terrible dancer.

24
00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:59.002
The goblin leader could not stand to watch him anymore.

25
00:01:59.022 --> 00:02:02.204
"Stop! You're making me dizzy!

26
00:02:02.604 --> 00:02:05.785
Can anyone teach this poor goblin to dance?"

27
00:02:06.286 --> 00:02:06.966
he begged.

28
00:02:08.006 --> 00:02:09.367
"Oh, I can!"

29
00:02:10.087 --> 00:02:12.408
The old man stepped into their view.

30
00:02:12.428 --> 00:02:15.930
"I used to be a dancer.

31
00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.951
See?" the old man said cheerfully.

32
00:02:19.651 --> 00:02:22.112
He showed the goblins his dancing skills.

33
00:02:22.833 --> 00:02:26.534
Well, there was no doubt, the old man knew how to move.

34
00:02:27.695 --> 00:02:30.856
All the goblins, including the leader, were impressed.

35
00:02:34.132 --> 00:02:37.835
"You must come back tomorrow night and teach us more steps!"

36
00:02:38.355 --> 00:02:39.156
said the leader.

37
00:02:39.176 --> 00:02:42.018
"I can teach you the tango!"

38
00:02:42.518 --> 00:02:44.560
the old man replied eagerly.

39
00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:51.085
"As a sign of promise, give me something that belongs to you," said the leader.

40
00:02:51.865 --> 00:02:54.707
He then removed the cyst from the man's face.

41
00:02:55.688 --> 00:02:56.609
It was gone!

42
00:02:57.269 --> 00:03:00.572
The big, ugly cyst was finally gone.

43
00:03:03.296 --> 00:03:07.337
The old man ran home and told his wife the strange story.

44
00:03:07.357 --> 00:03:12.899
"Your skin is smooth as a baby's," his wife remarked.

45
00:03:12.919 --> 00:03:15.100
"Just look at me!

46
00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.700
My cyst is gone forever!"

47
00:03:18.461 --> 00:03:20.121
The man began to dance.

48
00:03:22.582 --> 00:03:25.803
Next door lived the greedy landlord of the house.

49
00:03:26.483 --> 00:03:29.984
His favorite pastime was counting his money and gold.

50
00:03:31.032 --> 00:03:37.176
Unfortunately for him, he had a big, ugly cyst too, but on his left cheek.

51
00:03:37.197 --> 00:03:42.340
"I'm here to collect the rent," he told the old man.

52
00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:49.825
"I'm sorry, but I promise to pay it by tomorrow," the old man begged.

53
00:03:50.666 --> 00:03:52.707
"What happened to your cyst?"

54
00:03:53.288 --> 00:03:54.789
the landlord pointed.

55
00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:59.032
The old man told him about the goblins.

56
00:03:59.852 --> 00:04:07.395
"Then in exchange for your rent, I shall go see these goblins tonight," the greedy man replied.

57
00:04:09.476 --> 00:04:14.658
The old man had no choice but to allow the landlord to go instead of him.

58
00:04:15.979 --> 00:04:19.100
The landlord did exactly as the old man did.

59
00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:23.742
He hid in the hollow tree and waited until it got dark.

60
00:04:25.062 --> 00:04:29.144
Soon he heard dancing and singing, just as the old man had said.

61
00:04:31.481 --> 00:04:33.783
The leader of the goblins looked around.

62
00:04:33.803 --> 00:04:38.166
"I hope the old man keeps his promise," he said.

63
00:04:38.186 --> 00:04:43.850
At that moment the greedy landlord jumped out, spreading his fans.

64
00:04:45.671 --> 00:04:49.253
Pretending to be the old man, he began dancing.

65
00:04:51.075 --> 00:04:54.577
But unfortunately he was an awful dancer!

66
00:04:54.597 --> 00:04:57.079
"What happened to the tango?"

67
00:04:57.519 --> 00:04:58.720
asked one goblin.

68
00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.781
"Forget the tango.

69
00:05:01.321 --> 00:05:02.002
Do this!"

70
00:05:02.582 --> 00:05:04.303
the old man shouted back.

71
00:05:04.944 --> 00:05:07.345
He jumped up and down like a chicken.

72
00:05:08.086 --> 00:05:10.828
Finally the leader could stand it no more.

73
00:05:10.848 --> 00:05:12.409
"Stop it!

74
00:05:12.889 --> 00:05:13.790
We were wrong!

75
00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:18.453
You are a horrible dancer," yelled the leader.

76
00:05:18.473 --> 00:05:21.255
"Here, I give you back what I took!"

77
00:05:21.855 --> 00:05:24.977
The leader threw the cyst onto the right cheek.

78
00:05:25.578 --> 00:05:28.940
The landlord was greedy and had tricked the goblins.

79
00:05:29.436 --> 00:05:32.719
So he was left with a cyst on each cheek.
